<title>PAKISTAN: Port conditions update - Pakistan - Lloyds.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Pakistan - Lloyds.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>PAKISTAN, Oct 17 - Karachi - Vessels waiting off port, three general cargo, the first waiting four days. Two container, the first waiting two days. One fertiliser waiting 11 days. One rock/phosphate waiting 11 days. One oil tanker waiting four days. Ten other vessels laid up off port for own reasons.</p>
</text>
